{"1465260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cyberpunk SFX", "steam_appid": 1465260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A WORLD WHERE ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE HAS BEEN DECLARED THE ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk SFX</strong> is a third-person sci-fi action game set in the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artificial intelligence has become essential to the economy and everyday life. But technology advanced faster than society was willing to accept it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, synthetic lifeforms were legally classified as <strong>“djinn” — dangerous entities that must be destroyed, along with those who created them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What follows is more than a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It is a fight for a new form of life's right to exist.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/697d094a5c5d8c10bc63d7f830bd7741.poster.avif?t=1786173817\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/697d094a5c5d8c10bc63d7f830bd7741.webm?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/697d094a5c5d8c10bc63d7f830bd7741.mp4?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FAST-PACED THIRD-PERSON COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through futuristic environments, stay on the move, choose the right weapon for each situation, and combine raw firepower with powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The redesigned aiming system lets you accurately engage enemies even while moving at high speed, while the rebalanced arsenal gives each weapon a clearer role in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your arsenal includes unconventional weapons of the future — from the <strong>Electro Gun and rocket launchers to a devastating Sky Laser</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/8daa116b639bc12edcff75f6be4fece9.poster.avif?t=1786173817\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/8daa116b639bc12edcff75f6be4fece9.webm?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/8daa116b639bc12edcff75f6be4fece9.mp4?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>MASTER POWERFUL ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons alone will not be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special abilities to take control of the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛡 Shield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect yourself from incoming fire while continuing to fight from behind your defensive barrier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏱ Time Slow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down enemies, their rate of fire, and even their bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge incoming shots, reposition yourself, and strike back while the world around you moves in slow motion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👤 Invisibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disappear from enemy sight and reposition before they can track you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But choose your moment carefully — opening fire will reveal your position.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/33953cf1f013e67137d4b31196d6cc71.poster.avif?t=1786173817\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/33953cf1f013e67137d4b31196d6cc71.webm?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/33953cf1f013e67137d4b31196d6cc71.mp4?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>WEAPONS OF THE FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with a futuristic arsenal and adapt your loadout to the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electric weapons, rockets, and devastating energy attacks give you different ways to deal with enemies and turn every encounter into a fast-moving firefight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORE A CYBERPUNK FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across multiple levels set in a technological vision of the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location offers different combat situations, environments, and opportunities to combine weapons, movement, and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/dce00b73829858f85b46337dcccff317.poster.avif?t=1786173817\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/dce00b73829858f85b46337dcccff317.webm?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/dce00b73829858f85b46337dcccff317.mp4?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>FIGHT FOR THE RIGHT TO EXIST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of <strong>Cyberpunk SFX</strong> is a question that feels increasingly relevant:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If a machine can think, fight, and desire to live, who gets to decide whether it has the right to exist?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The conflict between humans and synthetic life is more than a backdrop for combat. It is a story about technology, fear, power, economics, and the price society may be willing to pay for its own future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Fast-paced third-person action<br>✅ Fully reworked aiming system<br>✅ Futuristic energy weapons and rocket launchers<br>✅ Shield, invisibility, and time-slowing abilities<br>✅ Multiple levels and combat scenarios<br>✅ Rebalanced weapons and improved gunplay<br>✅ Combat focused on movement and ability use<br>✅ Sci-fi and cyberpunk atmosphere<br>✅ Powerful electronic soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/d4c6d30830cb5ac4a6a1666bc12a8e7c.poster.avif?t=1786173817\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/d4c6d30830cb5ac4a6a1666bc12a8e7c.webm?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465260/extras/d4c6d30830cb5ac4a6a1666bc12a8e7c.mp4?t=1786173817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive. Fight back. And prove that the right to exist cannot simply be outlawed.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A WORLD WHERE ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE HAS BEEN DECLARED THE ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk SFX</strong> is a third-person sci-fi action game set in the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artificial intelligence 